### Obtener jobs de una ejecución de plan de trabajo — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkPlanJobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkPlanJobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1
}

### Validación: sin workPlanExecutionId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkPlanJobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Validación: workPlanExecutionId menor o igual a 0 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkPlanJobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 0
}

### Ejecución inexistente: devuelve lista vacía — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkPlanJobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 999999999
}
